ing representation of the file path. The file path must be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"writable as schema updates may be perfomed.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"filePath"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The completion handler to call once the contents of the given","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"file has been added to offline storage. This handler is executed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asynchronously on the main queue.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"completion"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The file must be a valid offline pack database bundled with the application or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloaded separately."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The resulting packs are added or updated to the shared offline storage object’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"packs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property, then the "},{"code":"completion","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block is executed."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/addContentsOfFile:withCompletionHandler:"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNBatchedOfflinePackAdditionCompletionHandler":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnbatchedofflinepackadditioncompletionhandler","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A block to be called once the contents of a file are copied into the current packs."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNBatchedOfflinePackAdditionCompletionHandler","fragments":[{"text":"MLNBatchedOfflinePackAdditionComp